        "Tabacales Rothschild / Toro / Titan (5 × 54 at $7.70 / 6 × 54 at $8.25 / 6 × 60 at $8.95; released 2025. Made at Tabacalera de García in La Romana, Dominican Republic — the marque's first non-Honduran production. Nicaraguan wrapper, Cameroon binder, Nicaraguan and Dominican fillers)",
